    "title": "Sons hope for answers in 1980 Jasper nurse bombing cold case - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Sarah Snyder ,\n10 hours ago After the death of a Tuscaloosa DCH employee outside the hospital May 12th, another case - decades old - comes back to light. 46 years ago, a nurse at a Jasper hospital was killed as she left work for the day. Her sons are hoping that by telling her story once again, they'll keep her memory alive and find answers. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 3",
